<h2>Agents · Skills</h2>
<p>The core of OMC is <strong>delegation</strong>. The main Claude takes the conductor role and splits the work among specialist agents with fixed roles. Each agent is automatically assigned a model matching the difficulty of the task (a high-performance model for design and analysis, a lightweight model for simple lookups), so it is more accurate and faster than having one person handle everything.</p>
<p>Agents fall broadly into four groups by role. Below are the main agents in each group and what each of them does.</p>

